free. If the glove wipes don't work for your pet, you'll get your money back.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.mbg-box {\ndisplay: flex !important;\nalign-items: center;\ngap: 14px;\nbackground: #EEF4FA;\nborder: 2px solid #6A9BC3;\nborder-radius: 10px;\npadding: 8px 14px;\nmargin: 10px 0;\nbox-sizing: border-box;\nwidth: 100%;\ntext-align: left;\n}\n.mbg-badge {\nwidth: 72px;\nheight: 72px;\nflex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.mbg-copy {\nmin-width: 0;\ndisplay: flex !important;\nflex-direction: column !important;\n}\n.mbg-box .mbg-title {\ndisplay: block !important;\nmargin: 0 0 2px !important;\nfont-size: 16px;\nfont-weight: 800 !important;\nline-height: 1.25;\ncolor: #1E2A5E;\n}\n.mbg-box .mbg-text {\ndisplay: block !important;\nmargin: 0 !important;\nfont-size: 14px;\nfont-weight: 400;\nline-height: 1.35;\ncolor: #3A4570;\n}\n@media (max-width: 749px) {\n.mbg-box { gap: 10px; padding: 7px 10px; }\n.mbg-badge { width: 60px; height: 60px; }\n.mbg-box .mbg-title { font-size: 15px; }\n.mbg-box .mbg-text { font-size: 13px; }\n}\n</style>"
